# Supabase project used by src/pages/api/subscribe.ts to store newsletter
# sign-ups. Create a free project at supabase.com (EU/Frankfurt region for
# RODO), run supabase/schema.sql in its SQL editor, then copy the values
# from Project Settings → API into a local .env (never commit real values)
# and into the same-named environment variables in the Vercel dashboard.
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
